  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "30",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mapatano gha duu na Wamisri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Ni bugha kwa awo wana winileghagha, awo wikatishagha mipango iseko yapo; wibonyagha mapatano ghisefumanyagha na kukunda kwapo, wikichuria kaung'a aighu ya kaung'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wifumagha kughenda cha Misri wiselolie njama kwapo. Wakusaghika na wulindiri ghwa mzuri, na kubonya Misri ikaie kiju chawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ugho wichafushwa waya wikakaia aisi ya wulindiri ghwa mzuri; na kuja kukuwika aisi ya kiju cha Misri kuchawibonya wikaie wa ndonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ngera wabaa na wadumwa wake wavika Soani na Henesi ya Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kula umu wa wandu wa Juda uchafushwa waya, kwa wundu ghwa wandu wisechaawitesia ilagho jingi, awo wisedimagha kuwiredia fwaida ingi hata wutesia ghungi, ela waya mduu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha ni malagho gha Mlungu aighu ya nyamandu ra Negebu. “Wandu widumilo waidia isanga ja ndengwa andu kuko na shimba ra waka na ra womi, na choka riko na wusungu, na iro riburukagha. Waduka mali rawo na punda, na misigo yawo ya zoghori kwa ngamila, kuwighenjera wandu wisedimagha kuwitesia na ilagho jingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutesia ghufunywagha ni Wamisri ndeghuwadie fwaida ingi putu. Kwa huwo nawinekie Wamisri irina ngawiwanga ‘Choka isena wusungu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wandu wisekiragha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ukanizera nighende na kuandika imbiri kwawo aighu ya kishawalata cha igho, na andenyi ya chuo, ghupate kukaia wushuhuda ghwa toe ghowonyera seji wandu awa wizamie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo rose wakaia waleghi na wandu weghora tee; wandu wisedimagha putu kusikira malaghiro gha BWANA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kuwizera awo wiwonagha, “Msewone;” na walodi, “Mselode malagho gha loli, ela modeghoragha agho gha ighu-ighu, na kudilodera tee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muisighe chia ya Mlungu, hata msesikire ilagho jingi ja Mlungu Mweli wa Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo, Mlungu Mweli wa Israeli waghamba huwu, “Kwa kukaia mwamenya malagho ghapo, na kurumiria andenyi ya makorongo na tee, hata mkusaghike naro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mawiwi agho ghichakaia konyu, sa wurigha mlacha ghughoghome, ghuko na lughuma lodima kughughusha shwa-shwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kughwa kwaro kuchakaia karakara na chombo cha mvimbi chabarika na ndighi, hata lusoweke luwigha lodima kudwa maka gha modo, angu lodaya machi kiriwenyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu Bwana MLUNGU, uo Mweli wa Israeli waghambie huwu, “Mkanighalukia na kukusaghika na ini, mchakia; nenyo mchakia na kukaia banana.” Ela mwaleghie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mkaghamba, “Ndedikunde! Isi dichakimbia kwa farasi redu riwadie iseghe,” na huwo mchakimbia kwa farasi riwadie iseghe, ela awo wimmbingagha wichamnugha kwa shwa-shwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wenyu elfu imweri, wichamkimbia mundu umweri wa wamaiza wenyu, na mkaturuswa ni wandu wasanu, mchakimbia mmbose putu. Mndungi onyu ndechaasigharika, ela mlingoti ghwa bendera ghoni aighu mghondinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa wundu ghwa agho, BWANA wakaia ukimmbeseria kumfuya wughoma putu, wakunde na ndighi kuwonyera wughoma ghwake aighu yenyu. Kwa kukaia BWANA ni Mlungu wa hachi; warasimilwa awo wose wimmbeseriagha na kusuwiria kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlungu kuwirasimia wandu wake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyo wandu wa Sioni, mkaiagha Jerusalemu, ndemchaalila sena. Kwa kukaia Mlungu uchakaia na wughoma aighu enyu loli. Iji mwamkemia umtesie, uchamsikira na kumtumbulia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ngera Bwana wam'bonyere kuja mkate ghwa wasi, na kunywa machi gha matiriro, ela sena Mwalimu wako ndechaakuvisa sena, ela kuchammbona na meso ghako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchasikira lwaka lukighora nyuma yako, “Ola chia ni iyo, muinughe; ngelo mghalukagha mkonu ghwa kiwomi angu ghwa kiwaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko aho mchazamilwa ni fwana ra milungu ishingilo feza, chiaimweri na rija richanilo ra dhahabu. Mcharida noko sa vilambo va wuchafu mkighamba, “Injikenyi noko!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkawa mbeu renyu ndoenyi, BWANA uchamredia vua, nenyu mchakuwida viro kwa wungi. Ngelo iyo mfugho renyu richakatwa ni nyasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njau renyu na punda wenyu welima wichaja mario gha nyasi idungilo chumbi na kusasawulwa kwa uma na mwiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo Mlungu uchaachikanya minara na kuwibwagha wamaiza, kuchakaia na meda ya machi ghiidagha kula mghondi m'baa na mtini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aighu ya agho, mwengere ghwa mori ghuchakaia sa ghwa iruwa, na iruwa jichachurikia mwengere ghwaro mando mfungade, sa mwengere ghwa matuku mfungade ghwakwanywa chiaimweri ingelo BWANA uchaafunga na kuboisa wandu wake, wereshoghonologhe ni ijo ikabo jake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlungu kuikaba Ashuru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
